'bottom' 时，文本的上方偏移量；position 为 'left' 时，文本的右方偏移量；以此类推在其他 position 时的情况。modelRect 节点的 offset 为左边距。</p>","name":"offset"}],"memberof":"KnowledgeGraph","longname":"KnowledgeGraph.NodeLabelCfg","scope":"static"},{"kind":"typedef","name":"NodeStyle","type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>节点样式通用配置项。</p>","properties":[{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>节点填充色。</p>","name":"fill"},{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>节点的描边颜色。</p>","name":"stroke"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>描边宽度。</p>","name":"lineWidth"},{"type":{"names":["Array.<number>"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>描边虚线，数组代表实、虚长度。</p>","name":"lineDash"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>设置填充的 alpha 或透明值。</p>","name":"fillOpacity"},{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>阴影颜色。</p>","name":"shadowColor"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>阴影范围。</p>","name":"shadowBlur"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>阴影 x 方向偏移量。</p>","name":"shadowOffsetX"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>阴影 y 方向偏移量。</p>","name":"shadowOffsetY"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>设置绘图的当前 alpha 或透明值。</p>","name":"opacity"},{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>鼠标在该边上时的鼠标样式，CSS 的 cursor 选项都支持。</p>","name":"cursor"}],"memberof":"KnowledgeGraph","longname":"KnowledgeGraph.NodeStyle","scope":"static"},{"kind":"typedef","name":"TextStyle","type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>文本样式。</p>","properties":[{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>设置文本内容的当前对齐方式。支持的属性：center / end / left / right / start，默认值为 start。</p>","name":"textAlign"},{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>设置在绘制文本时使用的当前文本基线。支持的属性:top / middle / bottom / alphabetic / hanging。默认值为 bottom。</p>","name":"textBaseline"},{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>字体样式。对应 font-style。</p>","name":"fontStyle"},{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>设置为小型大写字母字体。对应 font-variant。</p>","name":"fontVariant"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>字体粗细。对应 font-weight。</p>","name":"fontWeight"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>字体大小。对应 font-size，边标签文本默认大小是 7。</p>","name":"fontSize"},{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>字体系列。对应 font-family。</p>","name":"fontFamily"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>行高。对应 line-height。</p>","name":"lineHeight"}],"memberof":"KnowledgeGraph","longname":"KnowledgeGraph.TextStyle","scope":"static"},{"kind":"typedef","name":"EdgeLabelCfg","type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>node 节点配置项。</p>","properties":[{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>文本相对于边的位置，目前支持的位置有：'start'，'middle'，'end'。默认为'middle'。</p>","name":"position"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>标签在 x 方向的偏移量。</p>","name":"refX"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>标签在 y 方向的偏移量。</p>","name":"refY"},{"type":{"names":["boolean"]},"optional":true,"defaultvalue":true,"description":"<p>标签文字是否跟随边旋转，默认：true。</p>","name":"autoRotate"},{"type":{"names":["KnowledgeGraph.TextStyle"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>标签的样式属性，默认：{fontSize: 3,fill: '#333'}。</p>","name":"style"}],"memberof":"KnowledgeGraph","longname":"KnowledgeGraph.EdgeLabelCfg","scope":"static"},{"kind":"typedef","name":"EdgeStyle","type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"<p>边样式通用配置项。</p>","properties":[{"type":{"names":["string"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>边的颜色。</p>","name":"stroke"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>边宽度。</p>","name":"lineWidth"},{"type":{"names":["number"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>边响应鼠标事件时的检测宽度，当 lineWidth 太小而不易选中时，可以通过该参数提升击中范围。</p>","name":"lineAppendWidth"},{"type":{"names":["boolea